[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; Primary command trigger — teal-green fill, white text.
; Design: solid PRIMARY (#006c5c); gradient PRIMARY→PRIMARY_CONTAINER at 135°
; is the design intent but requires a shader; solid is the Godot-native equivalent.
; Set .text and connect .pressed in the parent scene.

